A //plumb directive on a method whose receiver type does not resolve (a typo’d or
undefined receiver) is tolerated-invalid input: the loader keeps going on type
errors, so discover must report a located diagnostic rather than crashing.
-- config --
import-path: example.com/app
package-name: app
error-is: ErrInvalidType
-- example.com/app/a.go --
package app

//plumb:build
func (r *Missing) New() int { return 0 }
